+|---|---|---|---|---|
+| Llama-3.1-8B | 7,419 | 11,895 | 10,713 | 4,505 |
+|  | (21.5%) | (34.5%) | (31.0%) | (13.0%) |
+| Qwen2.5-7B | 12,960 | 13,629 | 6,306 | 6,967 |
